<title>JAPAN: Asahi Brewing unit sees loss from Foster's share sale.</title>
<headline>Asahi Brewing unit sees loss from Foster's share sale.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asahi Breweries Ltd said on Friday that its wholly owned unit in Australia expects a loss of A$216.24 million from its sale of shares in Foster's Brewing Group Ltd.</p>
</text>
